 .../host_gpu/renderer/commandScheduler.cpp    | 18 +++++++++++
 .../host_gpu/renderer/commandScheduler.h      |  3 ++
 src/graphics/presentation/videoOut.cpp        | 30 ++++++++-----------
 src/graphics/presentation/videoOut.h          |  8 ++---
